talWarning: SQLite is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\n(node:32329) ExperimentalWarning: SQLite is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\n(node:32331) ExperimentalWarning: SQLite is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\n(node:32332) ExperimentalWarning: SQLite is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\n(node:32330) ExperimentalWarning: SQLite is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\n(node:32333) ExperimentalWarning: SQLite is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\n(node:32335) ExperimentalWarning: SQLite is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\n(node:32334) ExperimentalWarning: SQLite is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\n(node:32336) ExperimentalWarning: SQLite is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\nNOT-RAN: real-inference (LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY unset)\n\n Test Files  47 passed (47)\n      Tests  426 passed | 9 skipped (435)\n   Start at  03:33:18\n   Duration  4.48s (transform 4.09s, setup 0ms, import 21.56s, tests 41.71s, environment 3ms)\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
