 | `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all` | Existing suite passes under renamed vocabulary and v7 migration. | Logging TCs do not prove the mechanical rename preserved prior behavior. |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/stories/00-foundation.md:147:- Evidence: `packages/lhc/test/logging-surface.test.ts` exercises SDK-level logging calls and `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all` passes after the rename.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/stories/00-foundation.md:152:- Story gate: `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/stories/00-foundation.md:153:- Epic gate: `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/stories/05-runtime-change-typing.md:125:- Story gate: `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/stories/05-runtime-change-typing.md:126:- Epic gate: `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/stories/03-turn-construction-recovery-cascade.md:207:- Story gate: `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/stories/03-turn-construction-recovery-cascade.md:208:- Epic gate: `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/impl-run.config.json:62:    \"story\": \"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify\",\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/impl-run.config.json:63:    \"epic\": \"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all\"\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/tech-design.md:100:The deterministic result is the **floor** the cascade reuses (DD-5) and the over-cap output. There is no second field and no \"skipped\" state — over-cap and full both land `ready` (AC-1.4). The cap is `config.smoothing.maxInferenceTokens` (default named in the test plan; a dial-in value).\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/tech-design.md:102:Fenced code: a line in the `smoothing-v1` prompt instructs \"leave fenced code blocks and inline literals verbatim.\" No segmentation, no regex protection (AC-1.3). Verified by a fenced-code test against the deterministic provider's passthrough plus a real-inference test in the next epic.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/tech-design.md:315:Reuse the existing tiers (`red-verify` / `verify` / `green-verify` / `verify-all`); no new scripts. Story 0's rename is mechanically behavior-preserving — the existing suite green under the renamed vocabulary is its gate. The `tool_call_summary` removal is Story 2's (AC-2.5), a real behavior/schema change with its own red/green there. Recovery stories gate on `verify`. The provider doubles (`failingProvider`, `probingProvider`, `spyProvider`) live in `test/` fixtures alongside the existing deterministic provider.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/005-story-orchestrate-resume.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-orchestrate resume\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"accepted\",\"result\":{\"case\":\"completed\",\"outcome\":\"accepted\",\"storyId\":\"04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery\",\"storyRunId\":\"04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery-story-run-001\",\"currentSnapshotPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/001-current.json\",\"eventHistoryPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/001-events.jsonl\",\"finalPackagePath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/001-final-package.json\",\"finalPackage\":{\"outcome\":\"accepted\",\"storyRunId\":\"04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery-story-run-001\",\"storyId\":\"04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery\",\"attempt\":1,\