d\":\"019ec9bb-8dfb-76a0-815b-137a14133bc0\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019ec9bb-8dfb-76a0-815b-137a14133bc0\",\"storyId\":\"01-prompt-smoothing\"},\"mode\":\"initial\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"01-prompt-smoothing\",\"title\":\"Story 1: Prompt Smoothing\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/stories/01-prompt-smoothing.md\",\"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/tech-design.md\",\"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/test-plan.md\",\"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/01-prompt-smoothing/003-implementor.json\",\"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/01-prompt-smoothing/001-story-validate.json\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/handlers.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/smoothing.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/inference/prompts/smoothing-v1.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/compose.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/derive.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/tech-utils/work-queue/index.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/scheduler.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/derivation.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/sdk.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/smoothing-recovery.test.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/fixtures/provider-double.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/providers/deterministic.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Verified Story 1 against AC/TC mapping, tech design, implementor artifact, smoothing handler/floor/prompt code, turn composition recovery floor path, retry/terminal queue behavior, and configured gates. One blocking AC-1.3 production-path issue remains.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-01-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Deterministic cleaning mutates fenced code before inference\",\"evidence\":\"AC-1.3/TC-1.3a requires fenced code to remain unchanged through inference smoothing. `smoothPromptHandler` computes `cleaned = cleanPrompt(text)` and sends that value to `provider.smoothPrompt` (`packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/handlers.ts:83`, `packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/handlers.ts:104`). `cleanPrompt` applies whitespace and casing replacements to the whole prompt (`packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/smoothing.ts:3`-`10`). Direct repro: `cleanPrompt(\\\"fix this\\\\n```ts\\\\nconst  i = 1;\\\\n\\\\n\\\\treturn  i;\\\\n```\\\\nthanks\\\")` returned `\\\"fix this\\\\n```ts\\\\nconst I = 1;\\\\n\\\\nreturn I;\\\\n```\\\\nthanks\\\"`, changing spaces, tab indentation, and `i` inside the fenced block. The existing fenced test uses `const value = 1;` and a provider stub that returns a fixed preserved block (`packages/lhc/test/smoothing-recovery.test.ts:168`-`193`), so it does not prove byte-identical preservation for fenced content affected by deterministic cleaning.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/smoothing.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/handlers.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/smoothing-recovery.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-1.3\",\"TC-1.3a\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-01-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Deterministic cleaning mutates fenced code before inference\",\"evidence\":\"AC-1.3/TC-1.3a requires fenced code to remain unchanged through inference smoothing. `smoothPromptHandler` computes `cleaned = cleanPrompt(text)` and sends that value to `provider.smoothPrompt` (`packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/handlers.ts:83`, `packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/handlers.ts:104`). `cleanPrompt` applies whitespace and casing replacements to the whole prompt (`packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/smoothing.ts:3`-`10`). Direct repro: `cleanPrompt(\\\"fix this\\\\n```ts\\\\nconst  i = 1;\\\\n\\\\n\\\\treturn  i;\\\\n```\\\\nthanks\\\")` returned `\\\"fix this\\\\n```ts\\\\nconst I = 1;\\\\n\\\\nreturn I;\\\\n```\\\\nthanks\\\"`, changing spaces, tab indentation, and `i` inside the fenced block. The existing fenced test uses `const value = 1;` and a provider stub that returns a fixed preserved block (`packages/lhc/test/smoothing-recovery.test.ts:168`-`193`), so it does not prove byte-identical preservation for fenced content affected by deterministic cleaning.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/smoothing.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/handlers.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/smoothing-recovery.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-1.3\",\"TC-1.3a\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-1.1 / TC-1.1a, TC-1.1b: deterministic cleaning runs before provider work and over-cap prompts still store cleaned output.\",\"AC-1.2 / TC-1.2a, TC-1.2b: under-cap smoothing invokes `smoothPrompt`; over-cap smoothing stores deterministic output with no provider call.\",\"AC-1.4 / TC-1.4a, TC-1.4b: deterministic-only and inference-success smoothing land `ready`; no skipped/degraded state was found.\",\"AC-1.5 / TC-1.5a, TC-1.5b: retryable provider failure leaves `smoothed_prompt` pending and queued; turn composition consumes deterministic floor.\",\"AC-1.6 / TC-1.6a: intake queues `prompt_smoothing` and provider capture remains empty during intake.\",\"AC-1.7 / TC-1.7a, TC-1.7b: exhausted smoothing failure lands `failed` with reason; turn composition consumes deterministic floor.\"],\"unverified\":[\"AC-1.3 / TC-1.3a: fenced-code byte preservation is contradicted by `cleanPrompt` mutating fenced content before inference.\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm exec vitest run test/smoothing-recovery.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[\"`smoothPromptHandler` sends globally cleaned text to the provider, so under-cap production smoothing can mutate fenced code before the `smoothing-v1` prompt instruction has any chance to preserve it.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"No material fake-adapter, shim, placeholder, or fallback workaround was found beyond the fenced-code production-path mismatch above.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/01-prompt-smoothing/004-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-06-15T05:22:52.397Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-06-15T05:25:51.777Z\"}\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/004-verify.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"revise\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"3389dae8-da8f-40ec-9161-63e76feb126e\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.5\",\"sessionId\":\"019ec9d3-94c1-7a02-9c4d-651ecc9cf0ea\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019ec9d3-94c1-7a02-9c4d-651ecc9cf0ea\",\"storyId\":\"02-tool-result-rendering\"},\"mode\":\"initial\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"02-tool-result-rendering\",\"title\":\"Story 2: Tool-Result Rendering\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/stories/02-tool-result-rendering.md\",\"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/tech-design.md\",\"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/test-plan.md\",\"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/003-implementor.json\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/derivation.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/tool-result-rendering.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/view.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/index.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/handlers.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/compose.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/tech-utils/work-queue/index.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/inference/adapter.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/inference/prompts/index.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/inference/prompts/tool-result-v1.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/providers/deterministic.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/tool-result-rendering.test.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/view-boundary.test.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/view-pull.test.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/derivation-turns.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Initial verification of Story 2 against the story, tech design, test plan, implementation, focused tests, and configured gates. Gates pass, but two production rendering paths still violate Story 2 contracts, so the story is not ready for handoff.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-02-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Full-band boundary rendering still serves inference summaries before deterministic truncation\",\"evidence\":\"AC-2.1 requires full-band tool-result shortening to use deterministic truncation with no model call. In `packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts:86-97`, the at-or-behind-boundary path sets `short` from `ctx.toolResultSummaries.get(message.messageId)` before falling back to `deterministicTruncation(content)`. `packages/lhc/test/view-boundary.test.ts:243-245` locks this old behavior by expecting a ready summary verbatim for an abridged tail result. Therefore any in-threshold tool result with a ready provider-generated `tool_result_summary` can be served in the full-band boundary path instead of the deterministic truncation floor.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/view.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/view-boundary.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-2.1\",\"TC-2.1a\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true},{\"id\":\"SV-02-002\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Tail tool-call rendering still truncates recorded arguments\",\"evidence\":\"AC-2.5 says tool-call arguments render as-is wherever a tool call appears. Turn composition uses `JSON.stringify(block[\\\"arguments\\\"] ?? {})` directly in `packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/compose.ts:102-107`, but tail rendering still applies `deterministicTruncation(JSON.stringify(...))` in `packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts:70-76`. A direct render probe with a 240-character `cmd` argument returned `[tool call · exec] {\\\"cmd\\\":\\\"xxxx...… [truncated 50 chars]` with `includesFull:false`, proving the current tail surface does not render the recorded arguments as-is. The focused Story 2 test only covers a small turn-composition argument at `packages/lhc/test/tool-result-rendering.test.ts:166-188`, so this path remains uncovered.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/view.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/tool-result-rendering.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-2.5\",\"TC-2.5b\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-02-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Full-band boundary rendering still serves inference summaries before deterministic truncation\",\"evidence\":\"AC-2.1 requires full-band tool-result shortening to use deterministic truncation with no model call. In `packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts:86-97`, the at-or-behind-boundary path sets `short` from `ctx.toolResultSummaries.get(message.messageId)` before falling back to `deterministicTruncation(content)`. `packages/lhc/test/view-boundary.test.ts:243-245` locks this old behavior by expecting a ready summary verbatim for an abridged tail result. Therefore any in-threshold tool result with a ready provider-generated `tool_result_summary` can be served in the full-band boundary path instead of the deterministic truncation floor.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/view.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/view-boundary.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-2.1\",\"TC-2.1a\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true},{\"id\":\"SV-02-002\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Tail tool-call rendering still truncates recorded arguments\",\"evidence\":\"AC-2.5 says tool-call arguments render as-is wherever a tool call appears. Turn composition uses `JSON.stringify(block[\\\"arguments\\\"] ?? {})` directly in `packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/compose.ts:102-107`, but tail rendering still applies `deterministicTruncation(JSON.stringify(...))` in `packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts:70-76`. A direct render probe with a 240-character `cmd` argument returned `[tool call · exec] {\\\"cmd\\\":\\\"xxxx...… [truncated 50 chars]` with `includesFull:false`, proving the current tail surface does not render the recorded arguments as-is. The focused Story 2 test only covers a small turn-composition argument at `packages/lhc/test/tool-result-rendering.test.ts:166-188`, so this path remains uncovered.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/view.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/tool-result-rendering.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-2.5\",\"TC-2.5b\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-2.2/TC-2.2a queued in-threshold summary work off intake path\",\"AC-2.3/TC-2.3a-b tier target inputs for small and mid results\",\"AC-2.3/TC-2.3c and AC-2.7/TC-2.7a large-tier ready truncation with no inference work item\",\"AC-2.4/TC-2.4a-b per-tool guidance input and mechanically stamped outcome metadata\",\"AC-2.5/TC-2.5a removal of `tool_call_summary` from derivation, work, provider, and prompt registries\",\"AC-2.6/TC-2.6a canonical tool-result content preserved in message records\",\"AC-2.8/TC-2.8a worker terminal failure lands failed with reason and existing consumers have a truncation fallback\"],\"unverified\":[\"AC-2.1/TC-2.1a full-band rendering always using deterministic truncation\",\"AC-2.5/TC-2.5b tool-call arguments rendered as recorded on every rendering surface\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm exec vitest run test/tool-result-rendering.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run typecheck\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[\"`packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts` can serve ready `tool_result_summary` content in the at-or-behind-boundary full-band path instead of deterministic truncation.\",\"`packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts` truncates oversized tail tool-call arguments instead of rendering recorded arguments as-is.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"No fake adapter, placeholder provider path, or runtime shim was found in real app code for this story; provider doubles are confined to tests.\",\"`pnpm run verify` and `pnpm run verify-all` exited 0 on clean serial runs; both printed `NOT-RAN: real-inference (LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY unset)`, and no Story 2 finding relies on that external path.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/004-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-06-15T05:49:06.999Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-06-15T05:55:42.581Z\"}\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/007-continue.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-continue\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"a0efdbf3-8d89-4f1b-a538-ab72a206433b\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"