s land ready via deterministic truncation with no inference item\\\",\\\"AC-2.8/TC-2.8a terminal in-threshold summary failure lands failed with reason and consumers have truncation fallback coverage\\\"],\\\"unverified\\\":[]},\\\"gatesRun\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm exec vitest run test/tool-result-rendering.test.ts test/view-boundary.test.ts test/view-pull.test.ts\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"}],\\\"productionPathFindings\\\":[],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"same-session-implementor\\\",\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"additionalObservations\\\":[\\\"No fake adapter, placeholder provider path, runtime shim, or non-real production behavior was found in the directly touched Story 2 rendering paths.\\\",\\\"`packages/lhc/src/shared/view.ts:75-77` still has stale comment text for compact args and summary-or-truncation wording; runtime behavior and tests now match Story 2, but that comment should be cleaned up when touching the view contract docs next.\\\",\\\"`pnpm run verify` and `pnpm run verify-all` still print `NOT-RAN: real-inference (LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY unset)` while exiting 0; Story 2 verification evidence came from deterministic local paths and the configured gates passed.\\\"]}\"}}\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:220:- Story gate: `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:221:- Epic gate: `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:254:- **Verification tiers*