ry/rendering behavior and `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify` catches removed type references.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:215:- Story gate: `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:216:- Epic gate: `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:248:- **Verification tiers** are the existing `red-verify` / `verify` / `green-verify` / `verify-all`; no new scripts.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:274:| TC-1.4a | 1.4 | over-cap prompt | derivation state `ready` (not \"skipped\"/\"degraded\") |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:369:| Rename safety | Story 0 gate | rename is behavior-preserving (`verify-all` green under renamed vocabulary); `tool_call_summary` removal is a separate behavior change with its own red/green |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:473:        command: \"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify\"\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:476:        command: \"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all\"\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:487:      - \"`pnpm run verify` and `pnpm run verify-all` still print `NOT-RAN: real-inference (LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY unset)` while exiting 0; Story 2 verification evidence came from deterministic local paths and the configured gates passed.\"\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-s