ered ready content only over pending or failed rows, leaving already-ready worker output untouched.\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/compose.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added original-source prompt fallback when deterministic prompt floor is unavailable.\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/turn-cascade.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added focused coverage for floor-unavailable fallback, verbatim assistant/thinking/runtime ordering, multiple not-ready components, and the ready-row recovery write-back race.\"}],\"storyScopedAssessment\":\"Latest bounded child-operation changes remain scoped to the active story.\"},\"acceptanceChecks\":[{\"name\":\"story-gate-result\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all\"],\"reasoning\":\"Story gate cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all reported pass.\"},{\"name\":\"final-verifier-result\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/03-turn-construction-recovery-cascade/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/03-turn-construction-recovery-cascade/006-verify.json\"],\"reasoning\":\"Final verifier outcome is pass.\"},{\"name\":\"unresolved-findings-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[],\"reasoning\":\"No unresolved verifier findings remain.\"},{\"name\":\"scope-change-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[],\"reasoning\":\"No scope changes require further ruling.\"},{\"name\":\"production-path-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/03-turn-construction-recovery-cascade/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/03-turn-construction-recovery-cascade/006-verify.json\",\"No material production-path fake adapter, shim, placeholder, or non-real execution path found on the touched Story 3 surfaces.\"],\"reasoning\":\"No production-path decisions require further approval.\"},{\"name\":\"baseline-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"baselineBefore=399\",\"baselineAfter=426\"],\"reasoning\":\"The current baseline did not drop below the prior accepted baseline.\"},{\"name\":\"receipt-readiness\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/03-turn-construction-recovery-cascade/003-implementor.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/03-turn-construction-recovery-cascade/005-continue.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/03-turn-construction-recovery-cascade/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/03-turn-construction-recovery-cascade/006-verify.json\"],\"reasoning\":\"Receipt draft includes implementor evidence, verifier evidence, and a passing story gate.\"},{\"name\":\"commit-readiness\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"ready-for-impl-lead-commit\"],\"reasoning\":\"The story is ready for impl-lead to create the required commit.\"},{\"name\":\"Story 3 acceptance coverage\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"Verifier 006 verified AC-3.1 through AC-3.8, including TC-3.1a through TC-3.8d.\",\"Verifier 006 reports no unverified requirements and no open findings.\"],\"reasoning\":\"The latest verifier result explicitly covers every story-local acceptance criterion and test-plan mapping.\"},{\"name\":\"Prior verifier findings resolved\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"SV-03-001 resolved: recoverDerivation now updates only pending/failed rows, and the ready-row overwrite probe passed.\",\"SV-03-002 resolved: tests were added for TC